# Kickflip, press Up then Down just before landing: lands into a manual, ollie out, land:
# one combo "Kickflip + Manual" (x2).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
tap up 198
tap down 203
hold ollie 300..320
bot balance
run 520
expect event manualStart{trick=Manual} within 205..210
expect event manualEnd{trick=Manual,reason=ollie} within 318..323
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Manual,multiplier=2} within 400..480
expect no event bail
